{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1468470-a-guide-to-the-night","id":1468470,"title":"A Guide to the Night","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-21T02:03:36-08:00","id":1468470,"title":"A Guide to the Night","content":"<br /> <img src=\"https://d1vzi28wh99zvq.cloudfront.net/images/1/377996-thumb140.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><div align=\"center\"><b>From Eventide to Cock\u2019s Crow</b></div></span></span></span> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">For the people of the medieval world, night is a terrifying experience. As the sun draws close to the horizon, men and women retreat to their homes, barring doors and windows against the threats which emerge during the hours of darkness. Many dangers may lurk within the night, concealed in darkness, from wolves and roaming bandits, to the malevolent servants of the Devil. It is unsurprising, then, that many choose to hide from the night, retreating to a place of safety until the arrival of mornings.</span></span></span><br /> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b> The Mysteries of the Night</b></span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>A Guide to the Night</i> is a sourcebook for Vampire: the Dark Ages investigating the nature of night, during the medieval era. From the gathering dusk, to the dark and mysterious dead time, the stages of the medieval night have their own distinct and often menacing characters. This sourcebook provides detail and context for both players and Storytellers, allowing them to understand the manner in which Cainites can interact with the medieval world, and the dangers and threats which may lurk within the darkness.</span></span></span><br /> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>A Guide to the Night includes:</b></span></span></span></div><ul><li>A comprehensive examination of night in the medieval period.</li> <li>An examination of how Cainites interact with the night, from hunting and leisure activities, to some of the threats they may face.</li> <li>Rules to allow Storytellers to simulate various aspects of night in the medieval era.</li> </ul><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/377996/A-Guide-to-the-Night\" target=\"_blank\"><i>A Guide to the Night</i></a> is now available to purchase from the Storyteller's Vault.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/317-james_willoughby","name":"James_Willoughby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar317_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-21T05:55:25-08:00","id":1468485,"title":"","content":"Interesting supplement idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-21T13:44:56-08:00","id":1468524,"title":"","content":"Historic<i> Vampire</i> settings have an interesting problem. With <i>Vampire: the Masquerade</i>, all action takes place at night, and readers and players are expected to work out for themselves how the undead interact with humanity. And it works because, of course, people know what happens at night in the contemporary world. <br /> <br /> When you have historic settings, the books contain the same assumptions about players resolving matters in their own heads, yet this doesn't work so well, because most people don't have a clear idea of the character of the night in the medieval period, or the Victorian period, or whenever. The core rulebooks should, of course, deal with this to at least some degree, but generally don't. Yet, actually invoking the atmosphere of the night should be an important part of the game, and it is likely to prove difficult for the average Storyteller without a solid frame of reference.<br /> <br /> Hence, <i>A Guide to the Night</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/317-james_willoughby","name":"James_Willoughby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar317_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-21T18:18:44-08:00","id":1473013,"title":"","content":"As 2022 rolls around, I note that I still don't have any reviews up on the Storyteller's Vault for <i>A Guide to the Night</i>. If anyone would like a review copy, please PM me, and this can be arranged.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/317-james_willoughby","name":"James_Willoughby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar317_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-25T20:43:49-08:00","id":1473310,"title":"","content":"I purchased A Guide to the Night (I own all of your stuff as it's the best material on the Storyteller's Vault hands down), but I haven't gotten a chance to read it yet. When I finish it I'll give it a rating.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27237-snikabar","name":"Snikabar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}